# Format:
#   <source-path>  <target-path>  <status-code>
#
# Rules:
# 1. 301 Redirect: Forces canonical trailing slash on invitation slugs (prevents relative asset path resolution failures)
# 2. 200 Rewrite: Serves index.html cleanly for the invitation directory route
# 3. 200 Rewrite: Proxies all internal assets, scripts, media and stylesheets directly
# ==============================================================================

